        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "Per-vhost traffic from nginx JSON access logs ({app=\"nginx_access\"}) plus stub_status connection metrics. vhost is the Host header, so scanners show up with IPs and unknown names. Per-URI and per-client breakdowns exceed Loki's 500-series limit over long ranges; use Explore with a narrow time range for those.",
